			"notes": "### Wasteland v1.1.2-7.3\n**FIXES**\n* 'Harder Mobs' now have extra health again\n* Clouds are now the proper height\n* Player items no longer disappear when killed by creepers\n\n**ADDITIONS**\n* Stores now have foundations\n* Mobs now take fire damage from 'Bad Sun'\n* Wolf armor prevents fire damage from 'Bad Sun'\n\n**CHANGES**\n* New icon\n* Cold biomes can now spawn animals if there's grass"
