			"notes": "### CHANGELOG\n**Changes**\n* Changed Forests to use scorched dirt\n* Changed monster spawn list of Taiga to only Creepers and Armored Zombies\n* Lowred Labyrinth spawn chance to 1/1400\n* Ruins can now only spawn on baked mud\n* Ruins handcannon is now damaged\n* Ruins water bucket now has a 1 in 3 chance to BE a water bucket\n* Ruins are slightly more common\n\n**ADDITIONS**\n* Added 'Ruined Cities' biome\n* Added three ruin types to cities; Skyscrapers, Stores, and Houses\n* Added wolves to Taiga spawnlist (still requires grass)\n\n**REMOVALS**\n* Removed dirt from ruins"
